{
  "_doc": "Directed tests (UD-265): a changed path selects the tests of its area; the guards always run. Longest prefix wins.",
  "always": [
    "src/static.test.js",
    "src/env-example.test.js",
    "src/numbers-declared.test.js",
    "src/public-names.test.js",
    "src/image-imports.test.js",
    "src/openapi-valid.test.js",
    "src/error-codes.test.js",
    "src/quick-tests.test.js"
  ],
  "image": {
    "_doc": "Tests on the built Docker image (`npm run test:image`). A change under these paths selects them; without TEAM_PLATFORM_IMAGE they skip and say so, and the directed run prints the command. Building the image is never part of the directed run. 2026-10-26: the walkthrough failed for five days on origin/desarrollo because no selection reached it.",
    "paths": ["panel/", "packages/client/", "src/api/", "src/domain/", "src/analyze/", "src/extract/", "src/queue/", "src/events/", "src/providers/", "src/db/", "src/worker.js", "src/config.js", "src/testing/walkthrough-providers-module.js", "src/image.docker.test.js", "src/image-walkthrough.docker.test.js", "Dockerfile"],
    "tests": ["src/image.docker.test.js", "src/image-walkthrough.docker.test.js"]
  },
  "daemon": {
    "_doc": "Tests that need a real Docker daemon and do not skip without one (a skipped test did not pass): a change under these paths selects them, and the directed run fails if Docker does not answer. 2026-10-26: the SIGKILL test failed for days on origin/desarrollo because only the complete battery ran it; the sweep of the worker and DESTROY of the driver are what it walks.",
    "paths": ["drivers/docker-local/", "src/execute/machines", "src/execute/runners.js", "src/execute/handler.js", "src/worker.js"],
    "tests": ["src/execute/machines-sigkill.docker.test.js"]
  },
  "client": {
    "_doc": "A change in what shapes the API (routes, roles, codes, schemas, the rules the routes apply) runs the whole suite of packages/client (vitest): it talks to the real API, so it is what notices a server that changed under it (2026-10-26: 8 red tests that no change of the client had caused).",
    "run": "packages/client",
    "paths": ["packages/client/", "src/api/", "src/identity/", "src/domain/", "src/events/", "src/execute/routes.js", "src/config.js"]
